m_hold1                      assume  unprocessed
a_wait1                      assert  proven        informal-kind
m_hold2                      assume  unprocessed
a_wait2                      assert  proven        informal-kind
m_hold3                      assume  unprocessed
a_wait3                      assert  proven        informal-kind
=== B: fixed priority
--- informal-kind, limit 30s for each property
property                     type    status        engine     detail
m_hold0                      assume  unprocessed
