=== C: DMA version 2, channel 0 and channel 1
--- informal-kind, limit 60s for each property
property                     type    status        engine     detail
a_excl0                      assert  proven        informal-kind
a_fly0                       assert  undetermined             no engine reached a verdict
a_room0                      assert  undetermined             no engine reached a verdict
c_done0                      cover   covered       informal-kind depth 2
a_excl1                      assert  proven        informal-kind
a_fly1                       assert  undetermined             no engine reached a verdict
a_room1                      assert  undetermined             no engine reached a verdict
c_done1                      cover   covered       informal-kind depth 2
